
% WARNING: PROPRIETARY
the templates are:
    *a person* is a parent of *a child*.
    *a person* is an ancestor of *a descendant*.

the knowledge base which_test includes:
    a person is an ancestor of a descendant if 
        the person is a parent of a child
        which is an ancestor of the descendant.
    
    a person is an ancestor of a descendant if
        the person is a parent of the descendant.

query one is:
    Alice is an ancestor of Charlie.

scenario one is:
    Alice is a parent of Bob.
    Bob is a parent of Charlie.
    one expects answers [Alice is an ancestor of Charlie].
